],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94047","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-94047","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub/","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub/commit/18a4467bc4ec6390b1f841d8a468a37e9922f837","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub/issues/1094","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub/pull/1096","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub/releases/tag/v1.0.33","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-94047","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/submit/949562","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/407976","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/407976/cti","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2xcr-p42x-hfx6","source":"GitHub"},{"label":"Advisory reference","url":"https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2xcr-p42x-hfx6"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94047","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-266","CWE-269"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-94046","title":"A weakness has been identified in 0215AndrewFeng ACE-MCP up to 4.10.8.","desc":"A weakness has been identified in 0215AndrewFeng ACE-MCP up to 4.10.8. The affected element is the function get_file_snippet of the file getFileSnippet.ts of the component MCP Tool. Executing a manipulation of the argument projectRootPath/filePath can lead to path traversal. The attack may be launched remotely. The exploit has been made available to the public and could be used for attacks. isPathInsideProjectRoot only blocks filePath escaping the attacker-chosen projectRootPath; the root itself is untrusted client input - set projectRootPath=/etc, filePath=hosts and the guard passes. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.","score":2.1,"sev":"low","published":"2026-09-20T19:17:13.317Z","modified":"2026-09-21T17:19:19.133Z","window_date":"2026-09-20","activity_at":"2026-09-20T21:31:33Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94046","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-94046","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/0215AndrewFeng/ACE-MCP/","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/0215AndrewFeng/ACE-MCP/issues/1","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/Xh1Xxhg/public_exp/issues/3","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-94046","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/submit/949256","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/407975","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/407975/cti","source":"NVD"},{"label":"GitHub security advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8wj2-8g8v-vcxr","source":"GitHub"},{"label":"Advisory reference","url":"https://github.com/0215AndrewFeng/ACE-MCP","source":"GitHub"}],"related_cves":[],"advisories":[{"label":"GitHub Security Advisory","url":"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8wj2-8g8v-vcxr"}],"sources":["NVD","GitHub Advisory Database"],"kev":null,"primary_url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94046","cvss_vector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X","cwe":["CWE-22"]},{"id":"CVE-2026-94045","title":"A security flaw has been discovered in newbee-ltd newbee-mall up to 1.0.0.","desc":"A security flaw has been discovered in newbee-ltd newbee-mall up to 1.0.0. Impacted is an unknown function of the file controller/common/UploadController.java of the component Goods Save Endpoint. Performing a manipulation of the argument goodsName results in cross site scripting. The attack may be initiated remotely. The exploit has been released to the public and may be used for attacks. ImageIO.read() is a format-agnostic read - it returns non-null for a polyglot PNG|<img onerror> payload, which is exactly why the \"image-only\" guard is bypassable; the attacker-controlled suffix + /upload/** static mapping is what turns the upload into persisted XSS rather than a one-shot. The project was informed of the problem early through an issue report but has not responded yet.","score":2.0,"sev":"low","published":"2026-09-20T19:17:13.133Z","modified":"2026-09-24T13:17:16.910Z","window_date":"2026-09-20","activity_at":"2026-09-20T21:31:33Z","date_basis":"GitHub advisory publication","affected":[],"refs":[{"label":"NVD record","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94045","source":"NVD"},{"label":"CVE Program record","url":"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-94045","source":"CVE Program"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/newbee-ltd/newbee-mall/","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://github.com/newbee-ltd/newbee-mall/issues/126","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/cve/CVE-2026-94045","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/submit/949263","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/vuln/407974","source":"NVD"},{"label":"Reference","url":"https://vuldb.com/